    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, just sent over a folder with the draft for the Green Tech Subsidy Act and that internal impact report we discussed. Look through them ASAP. We have the meeting with Senator Miller tomorrow morning, and he's still sitting on the fence about the Section 4 subsection. We need to lock him in. Give me a tight, persuasive talking point I can use to get him on board with Section 4. Make it something he can repeat to his committee without sounding like a pushover.",
