      "content": "Here is a concise talking point you can present to Senator Miller: \"Section 4's targeted block funding for green resilience guarantees immediate results for our most vulnerable communities, securing political stability without expanding the federal deficit.\"\n\nThis approach highlights immediate benefits and fiscal responsibility while excluding the \"pushover\" label, allowing the Senator to confidently defend the decision in committee. You can use this as your closing argument to help secure the vote.",
