      "content": "That's a good start, but I'm a bit worried. If Miller's staff digs into the economic analysis from that internal report, they're gonna see that Section 4 actually puts a lot of the immediate cost on the mid-sized tech firms we're trying to protect. It might actually hurt growth in those sectors in the short term. \n\nHow do we handle that if he calls it out? I need to know exactly how to frame the economic impact so he doesn't feel like he's walking into a trap. Can you give me a way to explain away the potential industry drag?",
